      "Selects the s1 or s2-pro TTS engine through the model request header.",
      "Searches public reference voices by title through the model endpoint.",
      "Uses a public reference ID in a narration request.",
      "Explains supported audio formats, bitrate, latency, and prosody options.",
      "Guides asynchronous TTS submission and task polling."
    ],
    "limitations": [
